\f0\i0 \cf2 \'93I give you a solemn promise, in this tragic time of the passing of the first High Elvis of the Elvi of Ulyssia. I promise to never deviate from the vision of my predecessor; I will make it my life\'92s work walk in the shoes of him whose suede shoes I am perfectly fit to tie because, like him, I am a Clambake Elvis through and through.\'94\
Cheers went of from the crowd.\
