\f0\i0 \cf2 \'93Thank you very much. I also want to announce the second Parliament of the Elvi have, this morning decreed, in honour of teh first High Elvis, that every elected successor to this lofty office shall be a Clambake Elvis. I am but the second of the Clambake Dynasty.\
