\f0\i0 \cf2 With genuine humility, the kind that only a true Elvis could summon up, Tom hushed them down. \'93We have work to do, fellow Elvi. We are threatened. We are threatened by disease, and we are threatened by schism in our own kind. The Holy Rollers have forsaken the Oath of the Warranty and are being consumed by gospel music, exactly as we were warned against. Our warranty cards are our guising light Evolution takes our emancipation generations ago and teaches us that we are fit to be here because we 
